          <div class="number">01</div>
          <div class="des">
              <div class="title">1234</div>
              <p>At Skynet, we craft apps or websites tailored to your needs. 💻 Simply share your vision, and we’ll bring it to life. Our charges are minimal, with support exceeding industry standards. 🔧 We emphasize data security and cutting-edge tech like AI.</p>
