  <div class="section" id="description">
      <div class="content-fit">
          <div class="number">02</div>
          <div class="des">
              <div class="title">ABOUT US</div>
              <p>Our SkyneTBee Pvt Ltd, has over 10 wings, each handling key areas of app development, such as cybersecurity🔐, quality analysis, etc. On the top-right menu, we've listed developer wings like Apple App Development with Xcode and Swift, Android App Development using Java or Kotlin in Android Studio📱, etc. For privacy, we haven't disclosed details about confidential teams like cybersecurity.</p>
          </div>
      </div>
